msgstr "Start it: ``sudo systemctl start go-agnet``"

#: ../../devops/gocd.rst:79
msgid "使用"
msgstr "Usage"

#: ../../devops/gocd.rst:81
msgid "在新建 Pipelines 前，我们先了解一些基本的概念"
msgstr "Before creating a new pipeline, let's first go over some basic concepts"

#: ../../devops/gocd.rst:85
msgid "Task : Pipelines 中的最小单元，用于执行一个 linux 命令"
msgstr "Task: the smallest unit within a Pipeline, used to run a single linux command"

#: ../../devops/gocd.rst:87
msgid "Job : tasks 的集合，其中的 tasks 按照指定的顺序运行。如果其中一个 task 运行失败了，那这个 job 也随之失败，剩下的 task 也不再执行。"
msgstr "Job: a collection of tasks that run in a specified order. If one task fails, the job also fails, and the remaining tasks no longer run."

#: ../../devops/gocd.rst:89
msgid "Stage : jobs 的集合，其中的 job 之间不存在顺序依赖，所以一个 Stage 内的 jobs 可以同时运行。如果其中一个 job 运行失败了，那这个 stage 也随之失败，但其他的 job 依然会执行完成。"
msgstr "Stage: a collection of jobs with no ordering dependency between them, so jobs within one Stage can run at the same time. If one job fails, the stage also fails, but the other jobs still finish running."

#: ../../devops/gocd.rst:93
msgid "Pipeline : stages 的集合，其中的 stage 按照指定的顺序运行。如果其中一个 stages 失败了，那这个 pipeline 也随之失败，剩下的 stages 也不再执行。"
msgstr "Pipeline: a collection of stages that run in a specified order. If one stage fails, the pipeline also fails, and the remaining stages no longer run."

#: ../../devops/gocd.rst:98
msgid "Material : material 可以引发 pipeline 运行，material通常是一个源码仓库。GoCD Server 持续的访问 material ，当检测到变更时，pipeline 就开始运行了"
msgstr "Material: a material can trigger a pipeline run; a material is usually a source code repository. The GoCD Server continuously polls the material, and when a change is detected, the pipeline starts running"

#: ../../devops/gocd.rst:102
msgid "新建 Pipelines"
msgstr "Creating a Pipeline"

#: ../../devops/gocd.rst:104
msgid "在 Add pipeline 页面，我们使用项目名作为 pipeline 的名称，并使用 git仓库中的分组作为 pipeline 的分组"
msgstr "On the Add pipeline page, we use the project name as the pipeline name, and use the group from the git repository as the pipeline group"

#: ../../devops/gocd.rst:105
msgid "配置 Materials，填写 git 仓库地址，并填入分支"
msgstr "Configure Materials, filling in the git repository address and branch"

#: ../../devops/gocd.rst:106
msgid "配置 Stage/Job，这里 stage 命名为CI , 表明是持续集成阶段"
msgstr "Configure the Stage/Job; here the stage is named CI, indicating it's the continuous integration stage"

#: ../../devops/gocd.rst:107
msgid "指定 task 动作，这里我们运行一个自带测试的 docker 容器"
msgstr "Specify the task action; here we run a docker container that includes its own tests"

#: ../../devops/gocd.rst:110
msgid "运行 Pipelines"
msgstr "Running the Pipeline"

#: ../../devops/gocd.rst:112
msgid "在每次 git 仓库提交后，会触发 Pipelines 运行，GoCD Server 会记录各个阶段的构建结果"
msgstr "After every git repository commit, the Pipeline run is triggered, and GoCD Server records the build results of each stage"

